<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Iridium World size raised.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Iridium World size raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	Iridium World Communications Ltd</p>
<p>   Priced At						  $20</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range			$19 - $21</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			    12.0 million</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter			   Merrill Lynch</p>
<p>NOTE: Underwriter said the number of class A shares offered was increased to 12.0 million from 10.0 million.</p>
<p>Iridium is a developing global satellite network that will link wireless telephones worldwide.</p>
</text>
